# Caps every account engine and viewer together, leaving about 5 GB of the 12 GB server for the
# gateway, NGINX, SiYuan, sing-box and the system. Seven accounts at their measured engine peak
# (912M) plus viewers fit under it. At the cap the kernel kills only the largest process in this slice.
# No MemoryHigh or systemd-oomd here: MemoryHigh only stalls the growing engine, and on
# systemd 255 oomd's per-unit kill failed and fell back to killing every unit in the slice.
[Unit]
Description=GoodMorning account services

[Slice]
MemoryMax=7G
MemorySwapMax=0
